     "tipo": "dialogo",
     "titulo": "Dialogue: proposing environmental measures",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "林娜",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "面对「天气、季节与环境保护」，个人和社区分别能做什么？",
       "alumno": "Facing «weather, seasons and caring for the environment», what can individuals do and what can the community do?",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "王明",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "我想先听听不同人的看法。",
       "alumno": "First I want to hear different people's views.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "林娜",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "如果大家的意见不一样呢？",
       "alumno": "What if people's opinions are different?",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "王明",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "我们可以把理由写下来，再一起讨论。",
       "alumno": "We can write down the reasons and discuss them together.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "tipo": "texto",
     "titulo": "Reading: proposing environmental measures",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "应对「天气、季节与环境保护」需要长期措施，也需要社区参与。",
       "alumno": "Responding to «weather, seasons and caring for the environment» requires long-term measures and community participation.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "持续记录变化，才能判断哪些做法有效，哪些还需要调整。",
       "alumno": "Recording changes continuously makes it possible to judge which actions work and which need adjusting.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "比较几种办法时，可以先说明各自的优点和不足。",
       "alumno": "When comparing several options, you can first explain their advantages and disadvantages.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      }
     ]
